-- Migration 038 — flow_templates seed (Phase 5 / PR-6).
-- Ref: docs/Polaris V2/04f_PHASE_5_DEEP.md §3.7 + ADR-020 (4 starter templates).
--
-- Inserts the 4 GA starter flow templates. Generated by
-- ``apps/api/scripts/build_template_seed.py``; DO NOT hand-edit.
-- To change a template, edit ``apps/api/polaris_api/services/
-- flow_runtime/_template_defs/<slug>.json`` and re-run the
-- generator.
--
-- Idempotent via ``ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE`` — re-applying
-- the migration after a template edit refreshes the row in place.
-- The pre-PR-6 ``last_updated_at`` value stays NULL until the
-- conflict path fires, then bumps to now().
--
-- Gated on FLOW_TEMPLATES_SEED_ON_MIGRATE — defaults to true; set
-- to ``false`` in test/CI fixtures that need empty ``flow_templates``
-- (the gate is read by the seed script in
-- apps/api/scripts/seed_demo_flow.py — the migration itself runs
-- unconditionally; the gate sits at the operator-script layer).
--
-- The 4 categories (welcome / booking / lead-capture / opt-out)
-- match the ADR-020 buckets exactly. Phase 8 portal's "Start from
-- template" picker filters by category.

